   "meta": {
    "application": "BambuStudio-02.00.03.54",
    "profile_title": "TPU Climbers SUPER STRONG JOINTS",
    "profile_notes": "Climbers optimised for printing in TPU. Very strong joints I, like a few others really struggled to print the climbers with any kind of strength in the arms/legs. So I modified the print profile to print in TPU. This gives the joins exceptional strength, and the pegs are still stiff enough to peg into the holes. Ensure your filament is Very Dry, and use a releasing agent (i.e. glue stick) to help with removal. 3 plates, 2 with just one colour, and 1 with 2 together, in case you want to print in separate colours",
